WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.081
Back in the editor, choose Publish.

00:00:03.131 --> 00:00:08.194
The confirmation makes it clear that the saved changes will go live.

00:00:08.244 --> 00:00:10.525
Confirming publishes this page.

00:00:10.575 --> 00:00:14.434
Other pages and content items keep their own drafts,

00:00:14.484 --> 00:00:17.517
so they are not published by this action.
